// From approval.json. The approval state the host holds for one chat: Ask me (manual) or Auto
// within limits (auto), and the one grant an explicit user decision minted. A grant admits one
// host action on one resource revision (a pack update, a Dialect publication) within fifteen
// minutes, is consumed by the commit, and is never minted by model output. No approval crosses the
// engine slot today: the run proposes and ends, and the host acts on the proposal afterwards under
// this state; a model's request for more compute is a budget_paused event and the person's grant
// is a checkpoint grant (checkpoint.json); a question for the person is user_question. Read from
